    "# Assignment 3 on Fine-Tuning I: Teaching a Model a Specific Taxonomy\n",
    "\n",
    "Banks receive customer messages that need to be routed to the right internal team.\n",
    "**BANKING77** (Casanueva et al., 2020) is a dataset of 13,083 customer service\n",
    "messages labeled with 77 fine-grained intents. Here we'll work with a 10-intent\n",
    "subset, all related to cards and card payments. \n",
